  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Season the beef strips with salt and pepper.",
    "Grill the beef for 5 minutes per side, or until it reaches an internal temperature of 145 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Toast the bread rolls on the grill for 2 minutes.",
    "Spread a layer of chimichurri sauce on each bread roll.",
    "Assemble the sandwiches by placing a few slices of beef on each roll, followed by a slice of cheese, some lettuce, tomato, and red onion.",
    "Top with a sprinkle of parsley.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy.",
